{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"bb4a45633c3496c0","type":"group","x":0,"y":300,"width":4440,"height":240,"label":"Outside the system (device & paper)","color":"2"},
		{"id":"dba5b65c8f4ee80d","type":"group","x":0,"y":560,"width":4440,"height":240,"label":"HR","color":"5"},
		{"id":"4e57d1d52b8b14d6","type":"group","x":0,"y":820,"width":4440,"height":240,"label":"System (automatic)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"25c60b519851647f","type":"group","x":0,"y":1120,"width":4440,"height":200,"label":"Data saved (database)"},
		{"id":"ec9cbbae90553189","type":"group","x":0,"y":1360,"width":4440,"height":200,"label":"Build plan — 1 month (deadline Oct 30, 2026)"},
		{"id":"2b16d4dfc64ccc58","type":"text","x":20,"y":335,"width":160,"height":170,"text":"### Outside the system\n(device & paper)","color":"2"},
		{"id":"1e06d33f300093aa","type":"text","x":20,"y":595,"width":160,"height":170,"text":"### HR","color":"5"},
		{"id":"af34c12b55ec01a2","type":"text","x":20,"y":855,"width":160,"height":170,"text":"### System (automatic)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"6bc9172c8f622630","type":"text","x":0,"y":-140,"width":1250,"height":220,"text":"# Phase 1 (1-month MVP) — End-to-End Process Flow\n\n**HR exports from the device → imports into the system → generates the DTR → downloads the CSC Form 48 PDF.**\nOnly HR uses the system in Phase 1. Numbers = order of steps · ◆ = decision · red arrow = go back and fix.\nPlan: [[CVSU-DTR/v3/PHASE1-MVP-1-MONTH|PHASE1-MVP-1-MONTH]]"},
		{"id":"a51ba7eff1cdef3a","type":"text","x":1290,"y":-140,"width":640,"height":220,"text":"### Legend\n🟧 Outside the system (device, paper)\n🟦 HR action in the system\n🟩 System does it automatically\n⬜ Data saved (database tables)"},
		{"id":"8d7e8bb589d42c32","type":"text","x":225,"y":190,"width":850,"height":80,"text":"## ① One-time setup"},
		{"id":"6b481bede951fffb","type":"text","x":1125,"y":190,"width":1450,"height":80,"text":"## ② Import attendance"},
		{"id":"591cb5ac6bc6df34","type":"text","x":2625,"y":190,"width":850,"height":80,"text":"## ③ Generate DTR"},
		{"id":"403665d51d7856d2","type":"text","x":3525,"y":190,"width":850,"height":80,"text":"## ④ Download & print"},
		{"id":"8639789179306fee","type":"text","x":225,"y":335,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**0. Biometric device (MB20)**\nEmployees punch in/out every day\nRecords stay on the device","color":"2"},
		{"id":"8e4f480ebfb9236e","type":"text","x":225,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**1. Log in**\nHR account (email + password)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"eb82fa3a058a2e03","type":"text","x":525,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**2. Set up (once)**\n• Employees + biometric ID\n• Assign schedule (default 8–12, 1–5)\n• Holidays of the month","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e03e7e2536c197c3","type":"text","x":825,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**3. Create the month**\ne.g. *October 2026*\n(DTR period)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"f88c787de208a347","type":"text","x":1125,"y":335,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**4. Export from device**\nHR downloads attendance from MB20\n→ XLSX / CSV file (USB or software)","color":"2"},
		{"id":"28cb48d2278c4576","type":"text","x":1125,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**5. Upload file**\nImport page → choose file\n(overlapping files are OK)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"ac8a42c32070cd79","type":"text","x":1425,"y":855,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**6. Read & check file**\n◆ Valid format?\nColumns, dates, times, size","color":"4"},
		{"id":"8f3c9cd9972a3511","type":"text","x":1725,"y":855,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**7. Show preview**\nRows · matched employees\nUnmatched IDs · duplicates · errors\nDate range found","color":"4"},
		{"id":"08b3cf6e56db1d5e","type":"text","x":1725,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**8. Fix unmatched IDs**\n◆ Any unknown biometric ID?\nLink ID → employee","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2f1d97588296c201","type":"text","x":2025,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**9. Confirm import**\n“Import 885 new punches”","color":"5"},
		{"id":"9fbfc264b6b2c846","type":"text","x":2325,"y":855,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**10. Save raw punches**\nNo duplicates (device + ID + time)\nOriginal data never edited","color":"4"},
		{"id":"13a0b09f03adc040","type":"text","x":2625,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**11. Generate DTR**\nChoose month + department (or all)\nClick *Generate*","color":"5"},
		{"id":"dcb8d2f9ed87cf4d","type":"text","x":2925,"y":855,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**12. Calculate each day**\nPunches → AM in/out, PM in/out\nLate · undertime · absent · holiday\n→ DTR (DRAFT)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"ac2a5eab8ca1a9fc","type":"text","x":3225,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**13. Review DTR**\n◆ Looks correct?\nForm 48 preview · totals\nflags: missing punch, no schedule","color":"5"},
		{"id":"822d33da9dd85115","type":"text","x":3525,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**14. Finalize (lock)**\nDTR can't change anymore\n`DRAFT → FINALIZED`","color":"5"},
		{"id":"f74a06deaaa0dcfa","type":"text","x":3525,"y":855,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**15. Create PDF**\nCSC Form No. 48 layout\nsaved with verification code","color":"4"},
		{"id":"ca492f6d117b0705","type":"text","x":3825,"y":595,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**16. Download**\nOne employee → PDF\nWhole department → ZIP / merged PDF","color":"5"},
		{"id":"c7b7a0ce4a79f2cb","type":"text","x":4125,"y":335,"width":250,"height":170,"text":"**17. Print & sign**\nEmployee signs\nIn-Charge verifies & signs\nHR files the paper DTR","color":"2"},
		{"id":"2d0d7715babbcefc","type":"text","x":20,"y":1150,"width":160,"height":140,"text":"### Data saved"},
		{"id":"f91fef140d413717","type":"text","x":225,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":140,"text":"`users` · `employees`\n`employee_biometric_ids`\n`employee_schedules`"},
		{"id":"702a2338a98fbdc5","type":"text","x":825,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":140,"text":"`dtr_periods`\n`calendar_events`"},
		{"id":"e8d9a0849025f8b4","type":"text","x":1425,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":140,"text":"`stored_files`\n`attendance_import_batches`\n`attendance_import_errors`"},
		{"id":"128c345db9c3afcb","type":"text","x":2325,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":140,"text":"`raw_attendance_records`\n(append-only)"},
		{"id":"a6108c4b02a02a62","type":"text","x":2925,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":140,"text":"`processed_attendance`\n`dtrs` · `dtr_items`"},
		{"id":"07ef662d036f44ca","type":"text","x":3525,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":140,"text":"`dtr_documents`\n(PDF + SHA-256)"},
		{"id":"9b10cc3952c00d3f","type":"text","x":3825,"y":1150,"width":250,"height":140,"text":"`audit_logs`\n(DTR_DOWNLOADED)"},
		{"id":"13bf48d9215af400","type":"text","x":20,"y":1390,"width":160,"height":140,"text":"### Build plan\n4 weeks"},
		{"id":"c79a93e41509055c","type":"text","x":225,"y":1390,"width":850,"height":140,"text":"**Week 1 · Oct 5–9**\nProject setup, login, employees, biometric IDs, schedules, holidays, months","color":"5"},
		{"id":"6f61017b2f5d473f","type":"text","x":1125,"y":1390,"width":1450,"height":140,"text":"**Week 2 · Oct 12–16**\nMB20 file parser, upload, validation, preview, unmatched-ID mapping, confirm import (no duplicates)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"cef40b08c5efa94a","type":"text","x":2625,"y":1390,"width":850,"height":140,"text":"**Week 3 · Oct 19–23**\nCalculation engine + tests, generate DTR, Form 48 preview","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d55bac44e35c023e","type":"text","x":3525,"y":1390,"width":850,"height":140,"text":"**Week 4 · Oct 26–30**\nPDF, download (single/ZIP), finalize, deploy, HR test ✅","color":"4"}
	],
